  <item>
    <title>022｜那些值得等待的藏地品牌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69eb45071e94ae69211028c0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69eb45071e94ae69211028c0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 10:59:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从帆布包到咖啡豆，从精油香皂到藏文贺卡，当我们谈论藏地品牌时，我们在谈论什么？</span></p><p><span>这一期，我们从日常使用和送礼经历聊起，却聊到了更深的地方：作为消费者，我们在选择什么？本土品牌在做难而正确的事时，需要怎样的长期主义？文化传承是否是一种必须延迟满足的投资？</span></p><p><span>从拉萨的购物记忆到成都的品牌落地，从</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60c60edf000000000100b287?xsec_token=AB6S_UWch_r0yxVYS4l7wYDSQawrJzparifiv-V-LzGl4=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60c60edf000000000100b287?xsec_token=AB6S_UWch_r0yxVYS4l7wYDSQawrJzparifiv-V-LzGl4=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>诺诺</span></a><span>的儿童绘本到</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/606ebd34000000000101c661?xsec_token=ABciW-D2YtE9OqNs3ZrrpTRaLHgAbEtr6idqwZLdx8eOo%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/606ebd34000000000101c661?xsec_token=ABciW-D2YtE9OqNs3ZrrpTRaLHgAbEtr6idqwZLdx8eOo%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>迦入</span></a><span>的手工饰品，从</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c663dcc0000000011010bab?xsec_token=ABrw0JKGZFAu2WPkT51OGjequj_JVLsSIjutTdMYY-rWg=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c663dcc0000000011010bab?xsec_token=ABrw0JKGZFAu2WPkT51OGjequj_JVLsSIjutTdMYY-rWg=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>聖山</span></a><span>的青年文化到古林坊的咖啡，我们试图理解：这些品牌如何在商业与文化之间找到平衡，而我们作为消费者，又如何用每一次选择为这种坚持投票。</span></p><p><span>- timeline：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 从帆布包开始的藏地品牌清单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a> 五年沉淀：一个品牌的成长与坚持</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="848">14:08</a> 妈妈们认证的品牌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1139">18:59</a> 收到藏文贺卡的那一刻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 品牌背后的故事：文化传承需要长期主义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1709">28:29</a> 送礼的美学：选择有温度的文化符号</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">33:11</a> 拼图里的文化反哺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2252">37:32</a> 我们期待的未来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2536">42:16</a> 藏装的创新与争议：多一种选择总是好事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2846">47:26</a> 香料的更多可能性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3151">52:31</a> 在他乡，用小物件维系</span></p><p><em><span>- 本期提到的藏地品牌清单：</span></em></p><p><strong><em><span>服饰配饰类：</span></em></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c663dcc0000000011010bab?channel_type=web_search_result_notes&amp;parent_page_channel_type=web_user_board&amp;xsec_token=ABrw0JKGZFAu2WPkT51OGjek3KvjM0BH1AR4Ooth_bx-o=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c663dcc0000000011010bab?channel_type=web_search_result_notes&amp;parent_page_channel_type=web_user_board&amp;xsec_token=ABrw0JKGZFAu2WPkT51OGjek3KvjM0BH1AR4Ooth_bx-o=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>聖山 NERHI </span></a><span>/ </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/606ebd34000000000101c661?xsec_token=ABciW-D2YtE9OqNs3ZrrpTRaLHgAbEtr6idqwZLdx8eOo%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/606ebd34000000000101c661?xsec_token=ABciW-D2YtE9OqNs3ZrrpTRaLHgAbEtr6idqwZLdx8eOo%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>迦入Charu</span></a><span>/ </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60712461000000000100830a?xsec_token=AB1YWIzek5rYW-TWd8goEc0uEQ5Ukr73WY7dfgQ7u6ZAE%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60712461000000000100830a?xsec_token=AB1YWIzek5rYW-TWd8goEc0uEQ5Ukr73WY7dfgQ7u6ZAE%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>NORLHA</span></a><span>/ </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/656720790000000019012d2d?xsec_token=ABwlpgzL1RNphuitXtY4U1a0AKX7eCcRtxR-drWqrRVnM%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_note" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/656720790000000019012d2d?xsec_token=ABwlpgzL1RNphuitXtY4U1a0AKX7eCcRtxR-drWqrRVnM%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_not