    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在藏医的世界里，身体不仅是肉身，更是一张与自然、情绪、能量相连的地图。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们一起走近藏医的疗法、瑜伽与生命观，聆听这门古老智慧如何诠释健康与平衡。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 呼吸法、冥想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 深入藏医瑜伽：调节贪嗔痴，达到平衡状态的疗法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> 八种呼吸疗法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2252">37:32</a> 藏医五元素养生法：平衡身体，四季食养指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">41:44</a> 你的体质与咖啡饮品：咖啡因的建议与注意事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2754">45:54</a> 回归内心</span></p><span></span><p><span>投稿交流📪：goatmasheep@163.com（欢迎来信呀，和我们约个电话聊天）</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐🎵：Hang drum in the mountain - Carlos Carty</span></p><span></span><p><span>私信渠道：小红书同名，后台可以找我们聊天~</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播🎙：Dyla</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSkFV8FZKYFmXEwep5OO8bMqHcY.png"></figure>]]></description>
