  <item>
    <title>014 | 那些关于食物的记忆与偏爱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fe091ccdd692da156b3c36</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fe091ccdd692da156b3c36</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 07:35:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>食物不仅是维系生存的必需品，更是文化、记忆的关键载体。人类学家Mary Douglas曾说：“食物是一种社会语言。” 本期我们想用这一集，用母语，把关于家的味道、成长的记忆、城市的气息，一口一口慢慢聊出来。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 近况更新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 小时候最爱的食物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> 从德克士到俄洛桥烧烤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 昌都人现身说法：知名辣椒面探秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 最爱的非藏餐菜系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 从咖啡聊到饮料偏好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 昌都人早餐大不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>欢迎听友分享你的藏餐pick list（你的心头好）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpV1njm_EzP2Um_AASAhCixtahVS.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrPpCOhZe9ke6WHXi9LLfv0j0IcI.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎投稿交流📪：goatmasheep@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐🎵：</span><em><span>Alin</span></em><span>-ཨ་ལན། &nbsp;</span><em><span>宫巴</span></em><span>/戈桑玛</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播🎙️：不二；Dyla; Tiki; Loma</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTYwNVyjwb4vpvsaEXQmsOsRLs2.png"></figure>]]></description>
